  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilience and Inclusive Economic Development - USAID</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO is partnering with USAID to support the Inclusive Resilience in Somalia (IRiS) programme. The UK is supporting MSMEs and internally displaced people (IDP) to increase production, facilitate links to market and value-add in high-productivity sectors, including fisheries, livestock and agriculture. This component is delivered by DT Global.</narrative>
  </description>
